title: GaveCoresClancyTalk
---
Clancy: Well, I really hope Hypolita you got some useful information to go on.
Clancy: Don't forget about our outpost's commissary if you need supplies. 
Clancy: You're good for now, but come see me later. I can help repair or upgrade your vehicle or gear, 
Clancy: once you've some more experience under your belt.
<<jump ClancyDirectToMine>>
===

