title: ClancyDirectToMine
---
-> She mentioned a mine director called Fulmen.
Clancy: Yeah, I heard of the guy.
Clancy: Not like the scientists here, I hear his leadership methods can be... rough.
-> I'd like to look around here a bit more.
Clancy: You could head to the Choked Cavern Mines to the Southwest.
<<complete_objective DialogueCommands "TalkWithClancy05" >>
Clancy: It should be pretty full of things to find. Well, farewell.
===